reading: if W/ovl stays ~0.5 to a=1 and beyond, the arithmetic is a benign bounded
perturbation (the §372 reduction is tight). If W/ovl DROPS toward 0 as a->1 while overlap
stays positive, the arithmetic is precisely the ratio-deficit at criticality — and the
bent-prime going NEG where the true stays >=0 marks the exact sign-sensitive corner (§335).
